        "TileImage": "$($repository 776cd9fa-8f7b-42e2-9ed9-72328631a867).Image",
        "Description": "Terrible news Agent 47. Santa Claus has evaded all our attempts of capture and has retreated to the remote medical facility in Hokkaido. This particular facility specializes in facial reconstruction. I fear the worst has happened. \r\rSanta Claus is disguising himself as a cowboy billionaire named Amos Dexter. He thinks he is safe with a new identity here at the edge of the world. Prove him wrong.\r\rAlso, I&apos;m hungry, grab me something from the kitchen. Kill a guy.",
